WEBVTT

00:09.267 --> 00:10.367
ARE YOU READY, KIDS?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:10.400 --> 00:12.133
Kids:
AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
孩子们：
是的，是的，队长！

00:12.167 --> 00:13.867
I CAN'T HEAR YOU.
我听不到你说话。

00:13.900 --> 00:15.467
( louder ):
AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
（大声）：
是的，是的，队长！

00:15.500 --> 00:18.733
* OH...
* 哦...

00:18.767 --> 00:20.800
* WHO LIVES IN A PINEAPPLE
UNDER THE SEA? *
*谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ *

00:20.833 --> 00:22.800
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
* 海绵宝宝！

00:22.833 --> 00:25.200
* ABSORBENT AND YELLOW
AND POROUS IS HE. *
* 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的。 *

00:25.233 --> 00:26.700
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
* 海绵宝宝！

00:26.733 --> 00:28.933
* IF NAUTICAL NONSENSE BE
SOMETHING YOU WISH... *
*如果航海废话是
您想要的东西... *

00:28.967 --> 00:30.267
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
* 海绵宝宝！

00:30.300 --> 00:32.967
* THEN DROP ON THE DECK
AND FLOP LIKE A FISH. *
* 然后掉到甲板上
像鱼一样扑通扑通。 *

00:33.000 --> 00:34.767
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
* 海绵宝宝！

00:34.800 --> 00:36.700
* READY?
SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 准备好？
海绵宝宝！ *

00:36.733 --> 00:39.700
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
* 海绵宝宝！

00:39.733 --> 00:40.733
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
* 海绵宝宝！

00:40.767 --> 00:43.267
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
* 海绵宝宝！

00:43.300 --> 00:45.433
( laughs heartily )
（会心地笑）

00:45.467 --> 00:49.067
[Captioning sponsored by THE
U.S. DEPARTMENT OF EDUCATION
( plays airy tune )
[字幕由THE赞助
美国教育部
（演奏轻快的曲调）

00:49.100 --> 00:50.667
and NICKELODEON]
和尼克频道]

01:03.100 --> 01:04.167
( sizzling )
（铁板）

01:09.900 --> 01:15.133
( loud buzzing )
（大声嗡嗡声）

01:18.400 --> 01:23.000
( all pop to life
and commence buzzing )
（一切都栩栩如生
并开始发出嗡嗡声）

01:34.833 --> 01:35.967
( pop )
（ 流行音乐 ）

01:36.000 --> 01:37.567
( buzzing )
（嗡嗡声）

01:44.167 --> 01:48.367
Krabs:
SPONGEBOB! SPONGEBOB!
螃蟹：
海绵宝宝！海绵宝宝！

01:48.400 --> 01:49.967
WAKE UP, BOY!
醒醒吧，孩子！

01:50.000 --> 01:51.367
YOU'RE BURNING
ME MONEY!
你正在燃烧
我的钱！

01:51.400 --> 01:53.233
( alarm sounds,
SpongeBob yelps )
（警报声响起，
海绵宝宝尖叫）

01:53.267 --> 01:55.067
MR. KRABS, WHAT DO WE DO?
先生。蟹蟹，我们该怎么办？

01:55.100 --> 01:56.300
HERE, USE THIS.
在这里，使用这个。

01:56.333 --> 01:58.067
( grunts )
（咕哝声）

01:58.100 --> 01:58.933
( clang )
（叮当）

02:00.400 --> 02:01.367
( flames whoosh )
（火焰呼啸）

02:01.400 --> 02:03.567
( both whine in fear )
（两人都因恐惧而哀嚎）

02:03.600 --> 02:05.433
( blowing frantically )
（疯狂地吹）

02:05.467 --> 02:07.067
( teeth chattering )
（牙齿打颤）

02:07.100 --> 02:10.233
( imitating fire alarm )
（模仿火警）

02:10.267 --> 02:11.333
( gurgling )
（咕噜声）

02:16.100 --> 02:17.533
HOORAY!
HOORAY!
万岁！
万岁！

02:17.567 --> 02:21.400
( steam whistling )
（蒸汽呼啸）

02:21.433 --> 02:22.700
( sizzles )
（嘶嘶声）

02:22.733 --> 02:26.067
SPONGEBOB, COME
INTO ME OFFICE.
海绵宝宝，来吧
进入我的办公室。

02:27.167 --> 02:28.733
WHAT'S WRONG, BOY?
出了什么问题，男孩？

02:28.767 --> 02:29.567
WELL, I...
嗯，我...

02:29.600 --> 02:30.933
THIS IS THE FOURTH TIME
这是第四次

02:30.967 --> 02:32.533
I'VE HAD TO SCRAPE YOU
OFF OF SOMETHING.
我不得不刮你
离开某事。

02:32.567 --> 02:34.367
WELL, I'VE BEEN THINKING.
嗯，我一直在想。

02:34.400 --> 02:36.800
WE NEED TO GET YOU
THINKING ABOUT WORK.
我们需要找到你
思考工作。

02:36.833 --> 02:39.267
NO OFFENSE, MR. KRABS,
BUT I'VE BEEN THINKING
无意冒犯，先生。螃蟹，
但我一直在想

02:39.300 --> 02:41.600
ABOUT GIVING UP
MY COLD INDUSTRIAL LIFE
关于放弃
我冰冷的工业生活

02:41.633 --> 02:43.200
IN FAVOR OF
A MORE NATURAL
有利于
更自然

02:43.233 --> 02:45.467
AND FREE LIFE
AMONG THE JELLYFISH.
和自由的生活
水母之中。

02:45.500 --> 02:48.133
( laughs heartily )
（会心地笑）

02:48.167 --> 02:52.200
( laughter echoes )
（笑声回响）

02:52.233 --> 02:55.533
AH... SPONGEBOB,
YOU WOULDN'T LAST
啊...海绵宝宝，
你不会长久的

02:55.567 --> 02:58.033
EVEN ONE DAY
IN THE WILD.
即使有一天
在野外。

02:58.067 --> 03:01.167
THIS IS YOUR
NATURAL HABITAT.
这是你的
自然栖息地。

03:01.200 --> 03:04.033
THIS IS YOUR
WIDE-OPEN RANGE.
这是你的
范围广泛。

03:04.067 --> 03:06.900
THESE ARE
YOUR AMBER WAVES.
这些是
你的琥珀色波浪。

03:06.933 --> 03:11.233
AND THIS... OH, THIS
IS YOUR GOLDEN SCEPTER
还有这个...哦，这个
是你的金权杖吗

03:11.267 --> 03:14.533
WITH WHICH YOU RULE!
由你来统治！

03:14.567 --> 03:17.467
THAT'S BETTER THAN NASTY OLD
JELLYFISH, RIGHT, SPONGEBOB?
这比肮脏的旧的要好
水母，对吧，海绵宝宝？

03:17.500 --> 03:19.200
SPONGEBOB?
海绵宝宝？

03:19.233 --> 03:22.133
OH, I CAN TOO
LAST MORE THAN ONE DAY.
哦，我也可以
持续超过一天。

03:22.167 --> 03:24.200
I'LL SHOW HIM.
我会告诉他。

03:24.233 --> 03:26.233
AW, BARNACLES!
哇，藤壶！

03:26.267 --> 03:27.633
SPONGEBOB, WAIT.
海绵宝宝，等等。

03:27.667 --> 03:28.933
( screams )
（尖叫声）

03:28.967 --> 03:31.600
OH, HE'LL BE BACK,
ALL RIGHT.
哦，他会回来的，
好吧。

03:31.633 --> 03:33.600
HE'LL BE BACK.
他会回来的。

03:33.633 --> 03:34.933
AND, SQUIDWARD
还有，章鱼哥

03:34.967 --> 03:37.533
I WANT YOU TO HAVE
MY CAN OPENER.
我希望你有
我的开罐器。

03:37.567 --> 03:41.533
AND I THOUGHT
THIS FRIENDSHIP
WOULD NEVER PAY OFF.
我想
这份友谊
永远不会有回报。

03:41.567 --> 03:43.133
ARE... ARE... ARE...
是……是……是……

03:43.167 --> 03:46.100
ARE YOU SURE YOU WANT
TO GIVE ME THIS MAYONNAISE?
你确定要吗
给我这个蛋黄酱？

03:46.133 --> 03:47.567
IT'S ALL YOURS.
都是你的。

03:47.600 --> 03:52.233
AND THESE
OLD PHONE BOOKS?
还有这些
旧电话簿？

03:52.267 --> 03:54.033
ALL YOURS, OLD FRIEND.
都是你的，老朋友。

03:54.067 --> 03:56.533
PATRICK, THERE IS
ONE MORE THING
帕特里克，有
还有一件事

03:56.567 --> 03:58.667
I WANT YOU TO HAVE.
我希望你拥有。

04:01.900 --> 04:03.733
( gasps )
（喘气）

04:03.767 --> 04:06.067
( panting with excitement )
（激动得气喘吁吁）

04:06.100 --> 04:07.433
OL' RELIABLE?!
可靠吗？！

04:07.467 --> 04:08.800
( sobs )
（抽泣）

04:08.833 --> 04:10.133
HOWDY, Y'ALL.
大家好。

04:10.167 --> 04:12.567
HEY, SPONGEBOB, YOU
HAVING A GARAGE SALE?
嘿，海绵宝宝，你
正在进行车库拍卖吗？

04:12.600 --> 04:15.267
NO, SANDY, I'M GIVING UP
MY MATERIAL POSSESSIONS
不，桑迪，我放弃
我的物质财富

04:15.300 --> 04:17.567
TO LIVE IN THE WILD
WITH THE JELLYFISH.
野外生活
与水母。

04:17.600 --> 04:19.567
SPONGEBOB, OF
ALL THE CRAZY SCHEMES
海绵宝宝
所有疯狂的计划

04:19.600 --> 04:22.200
WHY WOULD YOU WANT TO LIVE
AMONG THE JELLYFISH?
你为什么想活下去
属于水母吗？

04:22.233 --> 04:24.733
THEY'RE COLD AND MEAN
AND NONE TOO BRIGHT.
他们冷酷刻薄
而且不太亮。

04:24.767 --> 04:28.300
OH, SANDY, THAT'S EXACTLY
THE RESPONSE I WOULD EXPECT
哦，桑迪，正是如此
我期望的回应

04:28.333 --> 04:32.300
FROM SOMEONE WHO LIVES
THE SHAM OF A LIFE
I ONCE LIVED.
来自活着的人
人生的骗局
我曾经活过。

04:32.333 --> 04:34.733
I'LL PROVE I DON'T NEED
THIS STUFF TO BE HAPPY.
我会证明我不需要
这件事让你快乐。

04:34.767 --> 04:37.700
MAYBE SOMEDAY YOU'LL
WISE UP AND JOIN ME.
也许有一天你会
清醒一点，加入我吧。

04:37.733 --> 04:38.967
GOOD-BYE.
再见。

04:39.000 --> 04:40.367
( pop )
（ 流行音乐 ）

04:40.400 --> 04:42.467
I WON'T BE NEEDING THESE.
我不需要这些。

04:42.500 --> 04:44.933
BUZZ, BUZZ, BUZZ, BUZZ, BUZZ...
嗡嗡声，嗡嗡声，嗡嗡声，嗡嗡声，嗡嗡声......

04:44.967 --> 04:48.700
HE TOOK OFF
HIS PANTS.
他起飞了
他的裤子。

04:48.733 --> 04:49.900
I'LL GIVE HIM
A WEEK.
我会给他
一周。

04:49.933 --> 04:51.767
I'LL GIVE HIM
11 MINUTES.
我会给他
11 分钟。

04:52.767 --> 04:56.300
PATRICK SAD!
帕特里克伤心！

05:00.200 --> 05:02.267
I'M HOME.
我回来了。

05:02.300 --> 05:04.767
I'M HOME! I'M HOME!
我回来了！我回来了！

05:04.800 --> 05:07.200
I'M HOME, I'M HOME, I'M HOME,
I'M HOME, I'M HOME, I'M HOME
我回家了，我回家了，我回家了，
我回家了，我回家了，我回家了

05:07.233 --> 05:08.633
I'M HOME, I'M HOME!
我回来了，我回来了！

05:08.667 --> 05:11.233
( sudden buzzing )
（突然嗡嗡声）

05:11.267 --> 05:14.100
BROTHERS AND SISTERS,
WAIT FOR ME.
兄弟姐妹们，
等我。

05:14.133 --> 05:15.900
( buzzing )
（嗡嗡声）

05:15.933 --> 05:17.267
BUZZ, BUZZ, BUZZ.
嗡嗡声，嗡嗡声，嗡嗡声。

05:17.300 --> 05:19.867
OKAY, I'M HERE.
好的，我在这儿。

05:19.900 --> 05:21.933
WAIT, I JUST GOT HERE.
等等，我刚到这里。

05:21.967 --> 05:25.233
MY JELLYFISH INSTINCTS
TELL ME TO GO...
我的水母本能
告诉我走...

05:25.267 --> 05:26.100
( slurps )
（啜饮）

05:26.133 --> 05:27.433
( pops )
（流行音乐）

05:27.467 --> 05:29.533
THAT WAY.
那样。

05:29.567 --> 05:31.867
* BUZZ, BUZZ, BUZZ,
BUZZ, BUZZ... *
* 嗡嗡声，嗡嗡声，嗡嗡声，
嗡嗡声，嗡嗡声...*

05:31.900 --> 05:34.667
( jellyfish buzzing )
（水母嗡嗡声）

05:37.100 --> 05:40.733
( chomping )
（咀嚼）

05:40.767 --> 05:42.433
( gags )
（笑声）

05:44.167 --> 05:46.633
MMM, THIS IS THE LIFE.
嗯，这就是生活。

05:46.667 --> 05:48.233
HEY, EVERYBODY,
BUZZ, BUZZ.
嘿，大家，
嗡嗡声，嗡嗡声。

05:48.267 --> 05:49.633
BUZZ TO YOU.
向您发出嗡嗡声。

05:49.667 --> 05:51.067
BUZZ, BUZZ.
嗡嗡声，嗡嗡声。

05:51.100 --> 05:52.267
NICE CURRENT TODAY.
今天电流不错。

05:52.300 --> 05:53.900
HEY, WHAT'S THE BUZZ?
嘿，有什么动静？

05:53.933 --> 05:56.467
HELLO, I'M JELLYBOB--
AND YOU ARE...?
你好，我是果冻——
而你是……？

05:56.500 --> 05:58.133
( electricity crackles )
（电流噼啪声）

05:58.167 --> 06:00.900
UH... NICE TO MEET YOU.
呃...很高兴认识你。

06:03.900 --> 06:05.933
( sniffing )
（嗅）

06:05.967 --> 06:07.833
MMM.
嗯。

06:10.767 --> 06:13.367
HERE, PATRICK,
HAVE A KRABBY PATTY.
在这里，帕特里克，
来一份蟹肉饼吧。

06:13.400 --> 06:14.633
( choking up )
（哽咽）

06:14.667 --> 06:16.133
THERE HE IS, PATRICK.
他在那里，帕特里克。

06:16.167 --> 06:17.400
SAY YOUR LINE.
说出你的台词。

06:17.433 --> 06:19.900
"WHY, THANK YOU, SANDY.
“为什么，谢谢你，桑迪。

06:19.933 --> 06:21.867
"I WOULD LOVE ONE.
“我想要一个。

06:21.900 --> 06:24.067
"(TAKE PATTY).
“（带上帕蒂）。

06:24.100 --> 06:27.233
"TOO BAD SPONGEBOB
ISN'T HERE.
“海绵宝宝太糟糕了
不在这里。

06:27.267 --> 06:29.700
"THESE ARE HIS FAVORITES.
“这些是他的最爱。

06:29.733 --> 06:32.933
"I SURE WISH HE'D COME HOME.
“我当然希望他能回家。

06:32.967 --> 06:35.000
(TAKE BITE)."
（咬一口）。”

06:37.000 --> 06:38.767
I CAN'T DO IT!
我做不到！

06:38.800 --> 06:40.033
SPONGEBOB!
海绵宝宝！

06:40.067 --> 06:41.733
COME BACK!
回来！

06:41.767 --> 06:43.233
PATRICK, I'M NOT COMING HOME.
帕特里克，我不会回家。

06:43.267 --> 06:45.633
I MISS YOU.
我想你。

06:45.667 --> 06:47.067
SANDY MISSES YOU.
桑迪想念你。

06:47.100 --> 06:49.867
EVEN SQUIDWARD MISSES YOU.
就连章鱼哥也想念你。

06:49.900 --> 06:51.533
WHOOPEE!
哇哦！

06:51.567 --> 06:53.733
( party music playing )
（派对音乐播放）

06:53.767 --> 06:55.767
I'M HAPPY HERE.
我在这里很高兴。

06:55.800 --> 06:57.967
THIS IS MY HOME NOW.
现在这是我的家。

06:58.000 --> 07:00.667
( Sandy grunting )
（桑迪咕哝）

07:00.700 --> 07:02.767
( sobbing )
（抽泣）

07:02.800 --> 07:06.633
SPONGEBOB!
海绵宝宝！

07:08.267 --> 07:09.933
( buzzing )
（嗡嗡声）

07:11.667 --> 07:14.167
HEY, EVERYBODY, I'M BACK.
嘿，大家好，我回来了。

07:15.633 --> 07:17.667
I THINK I'M GETTING
THE HANG OF THIS.
我想我得到了
这其中的窍门。

07:19.267 --> 07:22.567
( panting heavily )
（气喘吁吁）

07:22.600 --> 07:25.367
PATRICK, WHAT ARE YOU DOING?
帕特里克，你在做什么？

07:25.400 --> 07:34.467
IF I CAN'T HAVE YOU AS A FRIEND,
I'M GOING TO MAKE YOU A TROPHY.
如果我不能把你当朋友，
我要为你制作一座奖杯。

07:34.500 --> 07:38.067
I EVEN PICKED OUT
THIS NICE JAR FOR YOU.
我什至挑选了
这个漂亮的罐子送给你。

07:38.100 --> 07:39.800
PATRICK, GO HOME.
帕特里克，回家吧。

07:39.833 --> 07:41.633
I'M A JELLYFISH NOW.
我现在是水母了。

07:43.233 --> 07:45.467
( gurgling cry )
（咯咯的哭声）

07:47.333 --> 07:49.933
( panting )
（气喘吁吁）

07:49.967 --> 07:51.467
WOW!
哇！

07:53.000 --> 07:56.333
( continues gurgling cry)
（继续咯咯的哭声）

07:58.000 --> 08:00.167
Patrick:
I CAN SEE YOU
THERE.
帕特里克：
我能看到你
那里。

08:01.500 --> 08:02.633
I STILL SEE YOU.
我仍然见到你。

08:04.133 --> 08:06.867
YOU'RE GOING
TO LOOK GOOD
ON MY MANTEL.
你要去
看起来不错
在我的壁炉架上。

08:06.900 --> 08:10.167
FRIENDS FOREVER,
SPONGEBOB!
永远的朋友，
海绵宝宝！

08:13.467 --> 08:18.233
( panting slowing down )
（气喘吁吁的速度减慢）

08:18.267 --> 08:20.767
AHH.
啊啊。

08:22.467 --> 08:25.367
I GOT YOU NOW, SPONGEBOB.
我现在找到你了，海绵宝宝。

08:25.400 --> 08:26.200
( straining )
（用力）

08:26.233 --> 08:27.733
PATRICK, NO!
帕特里克，不！

08:27.767 --> 08:31.567
( SpongeBob panting,
Patrick yelling)
（海绵宝宝气喘吁吁，
帕特里克大喊）

08:38.400 --> 08:42.100
( grunting )
（咕哝）

08:47.267 --> 08:49.467
OKAY!
好的！

08:49.500 --> 08:52.267
SO THIS IS THE WAY
IT'S GOING TO BE.
所以这就是方法
一定会的。

08:52.300 --> 08:54.533
I HOPE YOU'RE HAPPY.
我希望你快乐。

08:54.567 --> 08:56.300
( groans )
（呻吟）

08:58.300 --> 08:59.933
WELL, THAT'S OVER.
好了，结束了。

08:59.967 --> 09:01.833
BACK TO JELLYFISH MATTERS.
回到水母问题。

09:01.867 --> 09:02.633
( drip )
（滴）

09:03.900 --> 09:06.400
MMM, JELLY.
嗯，果冻。

09:07.300 --> 09:09.367
( buzzing )
（嗡嗡声）

09:09.400 --> 09:12.133
AH, MY JELLYFISH BRETHREN
ARE RETURNING.
啊，我的水母兄弟
即将回归。

09:14.233 --> 09:15.967
GREETINGS, COMRADES.
同志们，你们好。

09:16.000 --> 09:20.433
( electricity crackles.
SpongeBob screams )
（电流噼啪作响。
海绵宝宝尖叫）

09:20.467 --> 09:22.200
( screaming )
（尖叫）

09:22.233 --> 09:25.633
OW! OOH! OW! OW!
噢！哦！噢！噢！

09:38.133 --> 09:42.067
BEING A JELLYFISH SURE IS FUN.
成为水母确实很有趣。

09:42.100 --> 09:44.767
BUZZ... BUZZ...
嗡嗡……嗡嗡……

09:44.800 --> 09:45.767
( crack )
（ 裂缝 ）

09:45.800 --> 09:46.833
BUZZ.
嗡嗡声。

09:48.833 --> 09:50.567
( shivering )
（发抖）

09:54.600 --> 09:56.033
( pop )
（ 流行音乐 ）

09:56.067 --> 09:59.100
( resumes shivering )
（又开始发抖）

09:59.133 --> 10:00.800
HEY!
嘿！

10:00.833 --> 10:02.467
EW, I'M ITCHY.
EW，我很痒。

10:02.500 --> 10:04.300
ITCHY-- WHY AM I SO ITCHY?
痒——为什么我这么痒？

10:04.333 --> 10:06.067
( screams )
（尖叫声）

10:06.100 --> 10:08.067
POISON SEA URCHINS.
毒海胆。

10:08.100 --> 10:10.567
OW, OW, ITCH, ITCH,
ITCH, ITCH, OW
噢，噢，痒，痒，
痒，痒，噢

10:10.600 --> 10:16.833
OOH, OW, OW, OW, ITCH, ITCH,
ITCH, ITCH, ITCH, ITCH...
噢，噢，噢，噢，痒，痒，
痒，痒，痒，痒……

10:19.067 --> 10:23.800
BUZZ, BUZZ, BUZZ, BUZZ, BUZZ
嗡嗡声，嗡嗡声，嗡嗡声，嗡嗡声，嗡嗡声

10:23.833 --> 10:28.567
BUZZ, BUZZ, BUZZ,
BUZZ, BUZZ
嗡嗡声，嗡嗡声，嗡嗡声，
嗡嗡声，嗡嗡声

10:28.600 --> 10:32.200
BUZZ, BUZZ, BUZZ, BUZZ
嗡嗡声，嗡嗡声，嗡嗡声，嗡嗡声

10:32.233 --> 10:36.400
BUZZ, BUZZ, BUZZ,
BUZZ, BUZZ...
嗡嗡声，嗡嗡声，嗡嗡声，
嗡嗡声，嗡嗡声……

10:36.433 --> 10:37.567
( thud )
（砰）

10:39.467 --> 10:42.867
( muffled ):
KRABBY PATTIES.
（低声）：
蟹肉饼。

10:42.900 --> 10:43.867
BUZZ...
嗡嗡声...

10:43.900 --> 10:44.867
( sniffs )
（嗅）

10:44.900 --> 10:45.733
BUZZ...
嗡嗡声...

10:45.767 --> 10:47.633
( sniffs )
（嗅）

10:48.300 --> 10:49.800
SANDY...
沙...

10:49.833 --> 10:52.133
BUZZ, BUZZ, BUZZ...
嗡嗡声、嗡嗡声、嗡嗡声……

10:52.167 --> 10:53.367
( sniffs )
（嗅）

10:53.400 --> 10:57.433
BUZZ, BUZZ, BUZZ, BUZZ...
嗡嗡声、嗡嗡声、嗡嗡声、嗡嗡声……

10:57.467 --> 10:59.233
WHAT HAVE I DONE?
我做了什么？

10:59.267 --> 11:03.267
I HAD A GREAT LIFE AND FRIENDS,
AND I GAVE ALL OF THAT UP.
我有美好的生活和朋友，
我放弃了这一切。

11:03.300 --> 11:06.567
All:
WELCOME HOME, SPONGEBOB!
全部：
欢迎回家，海绵宝宝！

11:07.667 --> 11:09.300
YOU GUYS ARE THE BEST.
你们是最棒的。

11:09.333 --> 11:10.733
I MADE A HUGE MISTAKE.
我犯了一个巨大的错误。

11:10.767 --> 11:12.200
PLEASE FORGIVE ME.
请原谅我。

11:12.233 --> 11:15.300
AH, QUIT YOUR BLUBBERING
AND HAVE A KRABBY PATTY.
啊，别哭了
还有蟹肉饼。

11:15.333 --> 11:16.900
DON'T MIND
IF I DO.
不介意
如果我这样做的话。

11:16.933 --> 11:18.567
AND I'LL SEE YOU AT WORK
我会在工作中见到你

11:18.600 --> 11:20.600
FIRST THING
TOMORROW MORNING.
第一件事
明天早上。

11:20.633 --> 11:22.600
AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
是的，是的，队长！

11:22.633 --> 11:25.267
SPONGEBOB, DO US
ALL A FAVOR...
海绵宝宝，我们一起吧
一切都好...

11:25.300 --> 11:27.433
DON'T MIND IF I DO.
如果我这样做，请不要介意。

11:27.467 --> 11:28.900
( snaps pants loudly )
（大声拍裤子）

11:28.933 --> 11:30.033
TA-DAH!
达达！

11:30.067 --> 11:31.767
AW.
艾沃。

11:31.800 --> 11:33.367
OKAY, THAT'S ENOUGH.
好了，够了。

11:33.400 --> 11:34.400
( growls
affectionately )
（咆哮
深情地）

11:34.433 --> 11:36.900
( all ooh and ahh )
（所有哦和啊）

11:36.933 --> 11:38.200
( meows )
（喵）

11:38.233 --> 11:40.333
COULD WE PLEASE
STOP THIS?
我们可以吗？
停止这个？

11:42.233 --> 11:44.633
PATRICK ITCHY.
帕特里克发痒。

11:44.667 --> 11:46.767
All:
OOH! OW! OH! OW! OOH!
全部：
哦！噢！哦！噢！哦！

11:46.800 --> 11:49.800
IT IS GREAT
TO BE HOME!
太棒了
回家！

12:03.600 --> 12:06.133
( crowing )
（啼叫）

12:08.633 --> 12:10.367
( snoring )
（打鼾）

12:10.400 --> 12:12.367
( SpongeBob and Patrick
jabbering )
（海绵宝宝和帕特里克
喋喋不休）

12:12.400 --> 12:13.433
HUH?
嗯？

12:13.467 --> 12:15.767
( jabbering stops )
（叽叽喳喳的声音停止了）

12:15.800 --> 12:16.967
( jabbering resumes )
（喋喋不休地继续）

12:17.000 --> 12:18.033
HUH?!
啊？！

12:19.067 --> 12:20.600
( blows noisemaker )
（吹响噪音）

12:20.633 --> 12:21.933
Both:
SURPRISE!
两者：
惊喜！

12:21.967 --> 12:24.933
HAPPY BIRTHDAY, SQUIDWARD!
生日快乐，章鱼哥！

12:24.967 --> 12:26.700
* HAPPY, HAPPY BIRTHDAY!
* 生日快乐！

12:26.733 --> 12:27.967
* HAPPY BIRTHDAY CAKE!
* 生日蛋糕快乐！

12:28.000 --> 12:29.367
* HAPPY, HAPPY BIRTHDAY!
* 生日快乐！

12:29.400 --> 12:30.967
* PIN THE TAIL
ON THE SEA HORSE! *
* 固定尾巴
在海马上！ *

12:31.000 --> 12:32.667
* HAPPY, HAPPY BIRTHDAY!
* 生日快乐！

12:32.700 --> 12:34.867
* HAPPY BIRTHDAY, SQUIDWARD!
*生日快乐，章鱼哥！

12:34.900 --> 12:37.300
( SpongeBob cheering,
noisemakers blaring )
（海绵宝宝欢呼，
噪音制造者发出刺耳的声音）

12:37.333 --> 12:39.300
SpongeBob:
SO LONG, SQUIDWARD,
BYE-BYE.
海绵宝宝：
再见，章鱼哥，
再见。

12:39.333 --> 12:40.967
DON'T DO ANYTHING
I WOULDN'T DO.
什么都不要做
我不会这么做。

12:41.000 --> 12:42.800
Patrick:
ANOTHER YEAR OLDER.
帕特里克：
又老了一岁。

12:42.833 --> 12:45.533
IT'S NOT MY BIRTHDAY!
这不是我的生日！

12:46.567 --> 12:48.133
THAT'S IT!
就是这样！

12:48.167 --> 12:50.933
I'M MOVING OUT
OF THIS NEIGHBORHOOD.
我要搬出去
这个街区的。

12:50.967 --> 12:52.700
Realtor:
ABSOLUTELY, MR. TENTACLES.
房地产经纪人：
绝对可以，先生。触手。

12:52.733 --> 12:54.833
I CAN SELL YOUR HOME
IN A HEARTBEAT.
我可以卖掉你的房子
一瞬间。

12:54.867 --> 12:56.367
OH, THAT'S GREAT NEWS
哦，这是个好消息

12:56.400 --> 12:59.267
BECAUSE I WANT TO MOVE
AS SOON AS POSSIBLE.
因为我想搬家
尽快。

12:59.300 --> 13:02.733
NO PROBLEM... AS LONG AS IT'S
NOT INFESTED WITH NEMATODES
没问题...只要它
未感染线虫

13:02.767 --> 13:05.200
OR SURROUNDED
BY TROUBLESOME NEIGHBORS
或被包围
惹麻烦的邻居

13:05.233 --> 13:06.800
OR SOMETHING LIKE THAT.
或者类似的东西。

13:06.833 --> 13:08.667
OH, SURE, THERE'S NONE OF THAT.
哦，当然，没有这些。

13:08.700 --> 13:10.300
DID YOU SAY NEIGHBORS?
你说的是邻居吗？

13:10.333 --> 13:12.000
Of course! I can't tell you
当然！我不能告诉你

13:12.033 --> 13:14.367
how many times
I've seen a sale fall through
多少次
我看到销售失败了

13:14.400 --> 13:15.700
because of bad neighbors.
因为邻居不好。

13:15.733 --> 13:17.300
NEIGHBORS, UH...
邻居们，呃……

13:17.333 --> 13:19.933
ANYWAY, I'LL BE BY TOMORROW
TO CHECK OUT THE HOUSE.
不管怎样，我明天就到
检查房子。

13:19.967 --> 13:20.933
SEE YOU THEN.
到时候见。

13:20.967 --> 13:22.833
SPONGEBOB.
海绵宝宝。

13:22.867 --> 13:26.133
NO ONE WILL EVER BUY MY HOUSE
WITH HIM LIVING NEXT DOOR.
没有人会买我的房子
他住在隔壁。

13:26.167 --> 13:29.300
WHATEVER A GOOD NEIGHBOR
WOULD DO, HE DOES THE OPPOSITE.
无论如何都是好邻居
会做，他却做相反的事。

13:30.700 --> 13:34.867
OPPOSITE... OPPOSITE.
对面……对面。

13:36.833 --> 13:38.667
( rooster crowing )
（公鸡打鸣）

13:40.233 --> 13:42.467
( cacophonous music playing )
( yells )
（刺耳的音乐播放）
（大喊）

13:42.500 --> 13:46.200
( playing loudly )
（大声播放）

13:46.233 --> 13:47.500
UH, SQUIDWARD...
呃，章鱼哥……

13:47.533 --> 13:49.500
WHY ARE YOU
PLAYING THE DRUM?
你为什么
打鼓？

13:49.533 --> 13:50.600
DRUM?
鼓？

13:50.633 --> 13:53.633
WHAT DRUM?
什么鼓？

13:53.667 --> 13:55.867
THIS IS JUST
MY WIG CASE, SEE?
这只是
我的假发盒，看到了吗？

13:55.900 --> 13:57.100
( cackles )
（咯咯笑）

13:57.133 --> 13:59.933
COME ON, SPONGEBOB, TACKLE ME!
来吧，海绵宝宝，来对付我吧！

13:59.967 --> 14:02.233
SQUIDWARD, YOU NEED BED REST.
章鱼哥，你需要卧床休息。

14:03.767 --> 14:04.967
I'LL KEEP
YOU SAFE
我会保留
你安全了

14:05.000 --> 14:06.500
UNTIL YOU'RE
WELL AGAIN.
直到你
又好。

14:06.533 --> 14:08.467
OH, I GET IT.
哦，我明白了。

14:08.500 --> 14:10.767
YOU DON'T KNOW WHAT
DAY IT IS, DO YOU?
你不知道什么
今天是，你呢？

14:10.800 --> 14:12.800
UH, WEDNESDAY?
呃，星期三？

14:12.833 --> 14:15.133
WHY, IT'S OPPOSITE DAY.
为什么，今天是相反的一天。

14:16.967 --> 14:18.133
YOU'VE NEVER HEARD OF IT?
您从未听说过吗？

14:18.167 --> 14:19.867
BOY, HAVE YOU BEEN MISSING OUT.
男孩，你错过了吗？

14:19.900 --> 14:22.467
OPPOSITE DAY IS
THE ONE DAY
OF THE YEAR
对面的日子是
有一天
年度最佳

14:22.500 --> 14:24.533
WHEN YOU GET
TO ACT DIFFERENT.
当你得到
采取不同的行动。

14:24.567 --> 14:27.667
NORMALLY I'M
STUFFY AND BORING
通常我是
闷闷不乐

14:27.700 --> 14:31.633
BUT TODAY I'M SILLY
AND SPONTANEOUS.
但今天我很傻
而且是自发的。

14:31.667 --> 14:32.767
( giggles )
（咯咯笑）

14:32.800 --> 14:35.167
DOES EVERYBODY KNOW
ABOUT OPPOSITE DAY?
大家都知道吗
关于相反的日子？

14:35.200 --> 14:36.633
OH, SURE.
哦，当然。

14:36.667 --> 14:38.767
IT'S A GAME, GET IT?
这是一个游戏，明白吗？

14:38.800 --> 14:41.100
OH, A GAME.
哦，一场游戏。

14:41.133 --> 14:42.633
YEAH.
是的。

14:42.667 --> 14:44.867
NORMALLY, YOU'RE
REALLY LOUD AND ANNOYING
通常情况下，你是
真的很吵而且很烦人

14:44.900 --> 14:46.867
SO WHAT ARE YOU
GOING TO BE TODAY?
那么你是什么
今天会吗？

14:46.900 --> 14:48.967
QUIET AND OUT OF THE WAY.
安静且不碍事。

14:49.000 --> 14:51.267
YAY!
耶！

14:51.300 --> 14:52.767
YEAH.
是的。

14:52.800 --> 14:54.333
WHY DON'T YOU GET A JUMP ON IT.
为什么不立即行动起来呢？

14:54.367 --> 14:56.367
( exuberantly ):
I LOVE...
（兴高采烈地）：
我爱...

14:56.400 --> 14:59.600
( gruffly ):
I MEAN, I HATE
OPPOSITE DAY.
（粗声粗气）：
我的意思是，我讨厌
相反的一天。

14:59.633 --> 15:01.900
( giggles )
（咯咯笑）

15:01.933 --> 15:03.933
( yelling ):
I'M NOT READY.
（大喊）：
我还没准备好。

15:03.967 --> 15:06.467
SO LONG, CHUM.
再见，密友。

15:06.500 --> 15:09.367
AND GOOD-BYE, BIKINI BOTTOM.
再见，比基尼泳裤。

15:09.400 --> 15:10.533
( door slams )
（关门声）

15:10.567 --> 15:12.200
GARY, IT'S OPPOSITE DAY
AND I'M--
加里，今天是相反的一天
而我——

15:12.233 --> 15:13.833
WALK, DON'T RUN--
走路，不要跑——

15:13.867 --> 15:15.867
AND I'M GOING TO...
我要去...

15:15.900 --> 15:18.600
OPPOSITE, OPPOSITE.
相反，相反。

15:18.633 --> 15:23.400
I'M JUST GOING TO CRAWL INTO BED
AND DO NOTHING ALL DAY.
我只是要爬上床
并且整天什么也不做。

15:26.233 --> 15:29.467
TOO BAD IT ONLY COMES
ONCE A YEAR, HUH, GARY?
可惜它只来了
一年一次，嗯，加里？

15:29.500 --> 15:30.700
( meows )
（喵）

15:30.733 --> 15:33.667
GARY, WHERE'S
YOUR HOLIDAY SPIRIT?
加里，在哪里
您的假期精神如何？

15:33.700 --> 15:34.800
( barks )
（吠叫）

15:34.833 --> 15:36.367
( doorbell rings )
（门铃响了）

15:36.400 --> 15:37.600
COMPANY!
公司！

15:37.633 --> 15:39.133
I HATE COMPANY.
我讨厌有人陪伴。

15:39.167 --> 15:40.967
WHO'S THERE?
谁在那儿？

15:41.000 --> 15:42.267
IT'S PATRICK.
这是帕特里克。

15:42.300 --> 15:43.767
PATRICK... GO AWAY!
帕特里克……走开！

15:43.800 --> 15:45.800
I NEVER WANT TO SEE YOU AGAIN!
我再也不想见到你了！

15:45.833 --> 15:46.967
( giggles )
（咯咯笑）

15:47.000 --> 15:49.533
( whimpers )
（呜咽）

15:49.567 --> 15:52.267
( sobbing )
（抽泣）

15:52.300 --> 15:55.167
SPONGEBOB DOESN'T
LIKE ME ANYMORE.
海绵宝宝没有
不再喜欢我了。

15:55.200 --> 15:56.700
THAT'S RIGHT.
这是正确的。

15:56.733 --> 15:59.000
YOU'RE MY WORST ENEMY.
你是我最大的敌人。

15:59.033 --> 16:01.700
( sobbing )
（抽泣）

16:01.733 --> 16:05.267
PATRICK, YOU'RE NOT
REALLY NOT MY FRIEND.
帕特里克，你不是
真的不是我的朋友。

16:05.300 --> 16:08.100
IT'S JUST OPPOSITE DAY.
这只是相反的一天。

16:08.133 --> 16:09.500
OPPOSITE DAY?
对面的日子？

16:09.533 --> 16:10.533
HEY, I'VE
HEARD OF THAT.
嘿，我已经
听说过。

16:10.567 --> 16:11.533
YOU HAVE?
你有吗？

16:11.567 --> 16:13.133
NO, WHAT IS IT?
不，这是什么？

16:13.167 --> 16:15.367
WELL, WHATEVER
YOU NORMALLY DO
好吧，无论如何
你通常会这样做

16:15.400 --> 16:17.267
TODAY YOU DO
THE OPPOSITE.
今天你做到了
相反。

16:17.300 --> 16:19.033
LET ME TRY,
LET ME TRY.
让我试试，
让我试试。

16:19.067 --> 16:20.333
( straining )
（用力）

16:24.200 --> 16:26.467
( still straining )
（还在紧张）

16:26.500 --> 16:27.467
PATRICK!
帕特里克！

16:27.500 --> 16:29.033
PATRICK, BREATHE!
帕特里克，呼吸！

16:29.067 --> 16:32.533
( exhales loudly )
（大声呼气）

16:32.567 --> 16:33.700
( gasping )
（喘气）

16:33.733 --> 16:35.633
NOT THAT OPPOSITE.
并非相反。

16:35.667 --> 16:39.033
LET ME SHOW YOU HOW TO DO IT...
THE WRONG WAY.
让我告诉你怎么做......
错误的方式。

16:45.167 --> 16:46.167
MEOW.
喵。

16:47.333 --> 16:48.400
MEOW.
喵。

16:54.833 --> 17:01.067
( speaking gibberish )
（胡言乱语）

17:01.100 --> 17:05.533
( laughing )
（笑）

17:05.567 --> 17:07.267
SAY, WANT TO HELP ME
说，想帮助我

17:07.300 --> 17:10.800
DO SOME WORK
AROUND THE HOUSE,
WORST ENEMY?
做一些工作
在房子周围，
最坏的敌人？

17:10.833 --> 17:12.033
NOPE.
没有。

17:13.800 --> 17:16.800
( laughing )
（笑）

17:16.833 --> 17:18.200
( Squidward cackles )
（章鱼哥咯咯笑）

17:18.233 --> 17:22.100
NEARLY NOON
AND NOT A PEEP FROM SPONGEBOB.
接近中午
而不是海绵宝宝的窥视。

17:22.133 --> 17:25.100
I'M ALMOST SORRY I'M LEAVING.
我几乎要后悔我要离开了。

17:25.133 --> 17:26.667
( cackles )
（咯咯笑）

17:26.700 --> 17:27.967
OPPOSITE DAY.
相反的一天。

17:28.000 --> 17:30.467
( crashing )
（崩溃）

17:30.500 --> 17:31.967
SPONGEBOB, WHAT ARE YOU...?
海绵宝宝，你是什么……？

17:32.000 --> 17:33.000
( yells )
（大喊）

17:33.033 --> 17:34.933
HELLO, SQUIDWARD.
你好，章鱼哥。

17:34.967 --> 17:39.833
OOP, I MEAN,
GOOD-BYE, SQUIDWARD.
哦，我的意思是，
再见，章鱼哥。

17:39.867 --> 17:43.467
ISN'T OPPOSITE DAY... TERRIBLE.
对面的日子不是……太可怕了。

17:43.500 --> 17:44.333
( laughs )
（笑）

17:45.900 --> 17:49.500
I'LL TELL YOU WHAT'S TERRIBLE:
LIVING NEXT TO YOU.
我会告诉你什么是可怕的：
住在您旁边。

17:49.533 --> 17:53.000
YOU'RE THE
WORST NEIGHBOR
IN HISTORY.
你就是
最坏的邻居
在历史上。

17:53.033 --> 17:56.233
WOW! THAT'S THE NICEST THING
SQUIDWARD HAS EVER SAID TO ME.
哇！这是最好的事情
章鱼哥曾经对我说过。

17:58.633 --> 18:01.333
IF THE REAL ESTATE AGENT
SEES THAT MESS
如果房地产经纪人
看到那乱七八糟的东西

18:01.367 --> 18:03.067
I'LL NEVER SELL THIS HOUSE.
我永远不会卖掉这房子。

18:03.100 --> 18:06.167
Patrick:
ISN'T IT BEAUTIFUL?
帕特里克：
不是很漂亮吗？

18:06.200 --> 18:07.933
ON OPPOSITE DAY IT IS.
相反的一天。

18:07.967 --> 18:10.300
( rumbling )
（隆隆声）

18:10.333 --> 18:12.467
OUT OF THE WAY, SPONGEBOB!
让开，海绵宝宝！

18:19.800 --> 18:21.167
( hammer pounding )
（锤子敲击）

18:22.633 --> 18:24.833
I DON'T GET IT.
我不明白。

18:24.867 --> 18:26.133
I MADE MY HOUSE
A MESS
我做了我的房子
一团糟

18:26.167 --> 18:27.667
WHICH WAS
MAKING IT CLEAN
哪个是
保持清洁

18:27.700 --> 18:29.467
WHICH MADE SQUIDWARD
CLEAN MY YARD
章鱼哥的诞生
清洁我的院子

18:29.500 --> 18:31.300
BUT THAT MEANS
HE'S MESSING IT UP.
但这意味着
他把事情搞砸了。

18:31.333 --> 18:32.967
BUT THE OPPOSITE
OF CLEAN IS FILTH
但事实恰恰相反
清洁就是污秽

18:33.000 --> 18:34.367
WHICH MEANS
FILTH IS CLEAN.
这意味着
污垢是干净的。

18:34.400 --> 18:36.100
SQUIDWARD'S MAKING
MY YARD A WRECK
章鱼哥的制作
我的院子一片废墟

18:36.133 --> 18:37.767
BUT I'D NORMALLY
WRECK MY OWN YARD
但我通常会
破坏我自己的院子

18:37.800 --> 18:40.200
SO SQUIDWARD'S
BEING THE OPPOSITE
OF SQUIDWARD
所以章鱼哥的
相反
章鱼哥

18:40.233 --> 18:42.000
WHICH MEANS
HE'S SPONGEBOB.
这意味着
他是海绵宝宝。

18:42.033 --> 18:44.333
AHA! I UNDERSTAND
EVERYTHING NOW.
啊哈！我明白
现在一切。

18:44.367 --> 18:46.967
I MUST BE THE OPPOSITE
OF SPONGEBOB BY BEING...
我一定是相反的
海绵宝宝的...

18:50.200 --> 18:51.867
SQUIDWARD.
章鱼哥。

18:51.900 --> 18:52.867
HEY...
嘿...

18:52.900 --> 18:55.833
I WANT TO BE OPPOSITE, TOO.
我也想反对。

19:00.133 --> 19:01.667
YEAH, FINALLY!
是的，终于！

19:01.700 --> 19:03.733
YOO-HOO!
哟吼！

19:03.767 --> 19:05.100
* I'M SQUIDWARD,
I'M SQUIDWARD *
*我是章鱼哥，
我是章鱼哥*

19:05.133 --> 19:06.267
* SQUIDWARD, SQUIDWARD.
* 章鱼哥，章鱼哥。

19:06.300 --> 19:07.933
WAIT.
等待。

19:07.967 --> 19:10.667
IT'S NOT ENOUGH TO LOOK LIKE
SQUIDWARD TO BE OPPOSITE.
光是看起来还不够
章鱼哥在对面。

19:10.700 --> 19:13.500
( imitating Squidward ):
YOU HAVE TO ACT LIKE HIM, TOO.
（模仿章鱼哥）：
你也必须像他一样行事。

19:13.533 --> 19:15.667
BOY, OH, BOY, DO I LIKE
PLAYING THE CLARINET.
男孩，哦，男孩，我喜欢吗
演奏单簧管。

19:15.700 --> 19:17.967
I PRACTICE AND PRACTICE
ALL DAY LONG
我练习再练习
一整天

19:18.000 --> 19:19.433
BUT I NEVER GET ANY BETTER.
但我从来没有变得更好。

19:19.467 --> 19:21.333
( in his own voice ):
NOW YOU TRY.
（用他自己的声音）：
现在你试试。

19:21.367 --> 19:22.700
OKAY.
好的。

19:22.733 --> 19:24.333
( inhales )
（吸气）

19:24.367 --> 19:26.867
* I'M SQUIDWARD, SQUIDWARD,
SQUIDWARD, SQUIDWARD. *
* 我是章鱼哥，章鱼哥，
章鱼哥，章鱼哥。 *

19:26.900 --> 19:29.633
Both:
* I'M SQUIDWARD, I'M SQUIDWARD
两者：
* 我是章鱼哥，我是章鱼哥

19:29.667 --> 19:30.700
* SQUIDWARD, SQUIDWARD.
* 章鱼哥，章鱼哥。

19:30.733 --> 19:32.967
AFTER YOU,
MR. SQUIDWARD.
在你之后，
先生。章鱼哥。

19:33.000 --> 19:36.600
WHY, THANK YOU,
MR. SQUIDWARD.
为什么，谢谢，
先生。章鱼哥。

19:36.633 --> 19:39.667
YOU'RE QUITE WELCOME,
MR. SQUIDWARD.
非常欢迎您，
先生。章鱼哥。

19:39.700 --> 19:41.500
OPPOSITE DAY.
相反的一天。

19:41.533 --> 19:45.800
NEXT TIME IT'S GOING TO BE
"GO JUMP OFF A CLIFF" DAY.
下次会是
“跳下悬崖”日。

19:45.833 --> 19:47.000
( tires squeal )
（轮胎吱吱声）

19:48.133 --> 19:49.800
OH, MY.
哦，我的。

19:49.833 --> 19:52.333
THE HOUSE IS EVEN MORE BEAUTIFUL
IN PERSON.
房子更漂亮了
亲自。

19:55.633 --> 19:58.300
HELLO, MIST...
你好，雾...

19:58.333 --> 19:59.667
UM, MR. TENTACLES?
嗯，先生。触手？

19:59.700 --> 20:01.533
YES, PLEASE COME IN.
是的，请进来。

20:01.567 --> 20:03.433
I PICTURED YOU
BEING MUCH TALLER.
我描绘了你
长得更高了。

20:03.467 --> 20:04.600
YEAH, EVERYONE
SAYS THAT.
是啊，大家
这么说。

20:04.633 --> 20:06.533
NOW, IF YOU WANT
THE SALE TO GO THROUGH
现在，如果你愿意的话
待完成的出售

20:06.567 --> 20:07.833
YOU'VE GOT TO TELL ME
你必须告诉我

20:07.867 --> 20:11.133
ALL THE POSITIVE
THINGS ABOUT
YOUR HOUSE.
所有积极的一面
关于的事情
你的房子。

20:11.167 --> 20:13.633
POSITIVE THINGS-- OPPOSITE DAY.
积极的事情——相反的一天。

20:13.667 --> 20:14.700
I'D LOVE TO.
我喜欢。

20:14.733 --> 20:17.500
THE FLOOR CREAKS,
THE ROOF LEAKS.
地板吱吱作响，
屋顶漏水。

20:17.533 --> 20:19.533
THERE'S
A TERRIBLE DRAFT.
有
糟糕的草案。

20:19.567 --> 20:23.700
UH... WELL, YOU DIDN'T
MENTION THAT ON THE PHONE.
呃...好吧，你没有
在电话中提及这一点。

20:23.733 --> 20:25.700
PLEASE LET ME FINISH.
请让我说完。

20:25.733 --> 20:27.200
THE WINTERS ARE HARD.
冬天很艰难。

20:27.233 --> 20:28.933
THE SUMMERS ARE BRUTAL.
夏天是残酷的。

20:28.967 --> 20:32.000
THERE'S A WILD MAN-EATING CLAM
IN THE BACKYARD.
有一种野生食人蛤
在后院。

20:33.233 --> 20:35.200
WOULD YOU CARE TO SEE THE REST?
您想看看其余的吗？

20:35.233 --> 20:38.433
WELL, I'M NOT SURE
IF I'M INTERESTED.
嗯，我不确定
如果我有兴趣的话。

20:38.467 --> 20:39.533
NONSENSE.
废话。

20:39.567 --> 20:41.700
I WON'T TAKE NO
FOR AN ANSWER.
我不会接受
寻求答案。

20:41.733 --> 20:44.600
( honking )
（按喇叭）

20:44.633 --> 20:47.333
PLEASE FOLLOW ME.
请跟我来。

20:47.367 --> 20:51.500
AND HERE'S THE WORST ROOM
IN THE HOUSE: MY GALLERY.
这是最差的房间
在房子里：我的画廊。

20:51.533 --> 20:55.167
OH, MY, THIS PAINTING
IS VERY NICE.
哦，天哪，这幅画
非常好。

20:55.200 --> 20:56.500
THANK YOU.
( screams )
谢谢。
（尖叫声）

20:56.533 --> 20:58.000
WHO'S THAT?
那是谁？

20:58.033 --> 21:01.233
I'D LIKE TO INTRODUCE
YOU TO MR. SQUIDWARD.
我想介绍一下
你对先生。章鱼哥。

21:01.267 --> 21:02.533
YOU'RE BOTH SQUIDWARD?
你们都是章鱼哥？

21:02.567 --> 21:04.300
I'M SQUIDWARD.
我是章鱼哥。

21:04.333 --> 21:06.133
HE'S SQUIDWARD.
他是章鱼哥。

21:06.167 --> 21:07.833
Both:
WE'RE BOTH SQUIDWARD.
两者：
我们都是章鱼哥。

21:07.867 --> 21:09.533
( sighs )
（叹气）

21:09.567 --> 21:11.000
WELL, THAT'S DONE.
好了，完成了。

21:11.033 --> 21:13.367
AT LEAST SPONGEBOB
HAS BEEN QUIET.
至少海绵宝宝
一直很安静。

21:16.333 --> 21:17.867
( screams ):
NO!
（尖叫声）：
不！

21:17.900 --> 21:19.300
( playing squeakily )
（玩得吱吱作响）

21:19.333 --> 21:22.133
OKAY, I REALLY
DON'T WANT TO
HEAR ANOTHER ONE.
好吧，我真的
不想
听听另一首。

21:22.167 --> 21:23.200
OKAY.
好的。

21:23.233 --> 21:24.300
( tooting )
（嘟嘟）

21:24.333 --> 21:27.133
I REALLY DON'T
WANT TO HEAR MORE,
THANK YOU.
我真的不知道
想听更多，
谢谢。

21:27.167 --> 21:28.600
I HEAR YOU
LOUD AND CLEAR.
我听到你的声音
响亮而清晰。

21:28.633 --> 21:29.933
( tooting )
（嘟嘟）

21:29.967 --> 21:30.933
Squidward:
STOP!
章鱼哥：
停下来！

21:30.967 --> 21:32.833
GET AWAY FROM HER!
离她远点！

21:32.867 --> 21:35.667
OH, OH, I AM SO SORRY, MA'AM.
哦，哦，我很抱歉，女士。

21:35.700 --> 21:38.200
I-I HOPE THESE
TWO BARNACLE-HEADS
我-我希望这些
两个藤壶头

21:38.233 --> 21:40.467
HAVEN'T HARMED YOU IN ANY WAY.
没有以任何方式伤害你。

21:40.500 --> 21:41.867
WHO ARE YOU?
你是谁？

21:41.900 --> 21:45.033
WHY, I'M SQUIDWARD.
为什么，我是章鱼哥。

21:46.633 --> 21:49.933
WHAT KIND OF FOOL
DO YOU TAKE ME FOR?
什么样的傻瓜
你把我当成是吗？

21:49.967 --> 21:50.933
HE'S SQUIDWARD?
他是章鱼哥？

21:50.967 --> 21:51.933
HE'S SQUIDWARD?
他是章鱼哥？

21:51.967 --> 21:53.367
YOU'RE SQUIDWARD?
你是章鱼哥？

21:53.400 --> 21:54.633
I'M SQUIDWARD!
我是章鱼哥！

21:54.667 --> 21:56.667
ARE THERE ANY
OTHER SQUIDWARDS?
有吗
其他章鱼哥？

21:56.700 --> 21:58.467
( in Squidward's voice ):
MEOW.
（用章鱼哥的声音）：
喵。

21:58.500 --> 22:01.100
I'M OUT OF HERE.
我要离开这里了。

22:01.133 --> 22:02.567
MA'AM, PLEASE.
女士，请。

22:02.600 --> 22:04.367
WHAT ABOUT MY HOUSE?
我的房子呢？

22:04.400 --> 22:06.700
I WOULDN'T SELL A HOUSE FOR YOU
我不会为你卖房子

22:06.733 --> 22:09.467
IF YOU WERE
THE LAST SQUIDWARD ON EARTH!
如果你是
地球上最后一个章鱼哥！

22:09.500 --> 22:10.267
WAIT!
等待！

22:10.300 --> 22:11.267
DON'T...
不...

22:11.300 --> 22:12.533
GO!
去！

22:12.567 --> 22:13.333
( screams )
（尖叫声）

22:13.367 --> 22:16.933
NO, NO, NO!
不，不，不！

22:16.967 --> 22:19.033
PLEASE SELL MY HOUSE.
请卖掉我的房子。

22:19.067 --> 22:20.133
NEVER!
绝不！

22:21.533 --> 22:24.133
DON'T LEAVE ME HERE!
别把我留在这里！

22:24.167 --> 22:26.100
( crying )
（哭）

22:26.133 --> 22:28.667
Both:
HAPPY OPPOSITE DAY, SQUIDWARD.
两者：
快乐的相反的一天，章鱼哥。

22:28.700 --> 22:31.033
WE HATE YOU.
我们恨你。

22:32.633 --> 22:39.633
LET ME SHOW YOU GUYS
HOW MUCH I HATE YOU.
让我给你们展示一下
我多么恨你。

22:39.667 --> 22:41.367
( engine revs )
（发动机转速）

22:41.400 --> 22:43.633
( yelling )
（大喊）

22:43.667 --> 22:44.833
PATRICK, YOU EVER FEEL
帕特里克，你曾经有过这样的感觉

22:44.867 --> 22:46.933
THAT SQUIDWARD
LIKES US TOO MUCH?
那个章鱼哥
太喜欢我们了？

22:46.967 --> 22:50.400
HAPPY OPPOSITE DAY!
对面的日子快乐！

